TITLE

*Set the defaults for precision simulations
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO
*Define the beam characteristics
!@scale=30
BEAM           -0.01                                                  PROTON
*Define the beam position
BEAMPOS            0         0      -1.6        -1
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME
    0    0          
*Black body
SPH blkbody    0.0 0.0 0.0 100000.0
*Void sphere
SPH void       0 0 0 10000.0
*Cylindrical target
RCC target     -1.2 0 -1.54 -0.1 0 0 1.0
*Cylindrical target
RCC target1    -0.7 -0.6 -0.7 0.15 0 0.2598076211353 1.6911325286277
RPP Q6         -3.5 2.0 -5.0 4.0 -5.0 5.0
RPP Q7         -1.0 0.4 -0.8 1.0 -3.0 -1.5
RPP Q8         -1.0005 -1.0 -0.8 1.0 -3.0 -1.5
END
*Black hole
BLKBODY      5 +blkbody -void
#if 0
*Target
TARGET       5 +target
#endif
AR           5 +void +Q6 -target -target1 -Q7 -Q8
VACUUM       5 +void +Q6 +Q7 -Q8
ALVO         5 +void +target +Q6
DETECTOR     5 +void +target1 +Q6
JANELA       5 +void +Q6 +Q8 -Q7
VOID         5 +void -target -target1 -Q6 -Q7 -Q8
END
GEOEND
MATERIAL          24                7.18                              CHROMIUM
MATERIAL          25                7.21                              MANGANES
MATERIAL          15                1.82                              PHOSPHO
MATERIAL          16                2.07                              SULFUR
*Steel316LN
*Stainless steel AISI316LN
MATERIAL                             7.8                              SS316LN
COMPOUND    -0.67145      IRON    -0.185  CHROMIUM   -0.1125    NICKELSS316LN
COMPOUND       -0.02  MANGANES     -0.01   SILICON  -0.00045   PHOSPHOSS316LN
COMPOUND     -0.0003    SULFUR   -0.0003    CARBON                    SS316LN
*..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE   BLKBODY
ASSIGNMA         AIR        AR
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    VACUUM
ASSIGNMA      COPPER      ALVO
ASSIGNMA     SILICON  DETECTOR
ASSIGNMA    ALUMINUM    JANELA
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM      VOID
EMFCUT        -1E-06      1E-7      1E-5    COPPER                    PROD-CUT
EMFCUT        -1E-06      1E-7                  AR  DETECTOR
SCORE         PHOTON    ENERGY
*USERDUMP         100        21         0         1                    DUMP1
*USRBIN            10    PROTON       -23       3.5       5.2         8bin4
*USRBIN          -3.5        -5        -8       100         1       100 &
USRBIN            10    PHOTON       -24         2         4         5bin5
USRBIN          -3.6        -5        -5       100       100       100 &
USRBDX           101    PHOTON       -32        AR  DETECTOR          detec9
USRBDX         20E-6      1E-6       200                               &
*Set the random number seed
RANDOMIZ          1.        6.
*Set the number of primary histories to be simulated in the run
START      124200000
STOP
